OL,3,GNEWSA'Terrifying balaclava gangs' and
OL,4,A'CCTV in family home'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHere's our weekly round up of stories
OL,7,Ffrom across local websites in the West
OL,8,Fof England.
OL,10,FThis week's news was dominated by the
OL,11,Fmajor incident and counter-terror
OL,12,Finvestigation launched near RAF
OL,13,FFairford. Five British nationals in
OL,14,Ftheir 20s were arrested and released on
OL,15,Fbail and homes near the base were
OL,16,Fevacuated until Monday evening. Wilts
OL,17,Fand Gloucestershire Standard kept
OL,18,Freaders up to date as the story
OL,19,Fdeveloped rapidly.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
