OL,3,GNEWSA'Terrifying balaclava gangs' and
OL,4,A'CCTV in family home'
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday evening, the Weston
OL,7,FMercury reported on the evacuation of
OL,8,Fresidents in Worle. A large cordon was
OL,9,Fset up following the discovery of
OL,10,Fsuspicious substances and items at a
OL,11,Fproperty.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
