OL,3,GNEWSA'Terrifying balaclava gangs' and
OL,4,A'CCTV in family home'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMeanwhile, Hartcliffe and Withywood
OL,7,Fcouncillor Kirsty Tait called for more
OL,8,Fneighbourhood police on the streets and
OL,9,Fyouth workers as she said that
OL,10,F"balaclava gangs" and knife crime in
OL,11,Fsouth Bristol are "absolutely
OL,12,Fterrifying". Bristol Live reported that
OL,13,Fshe addressed the Labour Party
OL,14,Fconference in Liverpool and described
OL,15,Fthe devastating case of best friends
OL,16,FMax Dixon and Mason Rist, who were
OL,17,Fmurdered in a case of mistaken identity
OL,18,Fin 2024.
